The following skills are forks of Superpowers skills, rewritten so their
artifacts land on a tuckit board instead of in markdown files:

  shared/skills/designing-a-slice/      <- skills/brainstorming
  shared/skills/breaking-down-a-slice/  <- skills/writing-plans
  shared/skills/executing-a-slice/      <- skills/executing-plans
  shared/skills/delegating-a-slice/     <- skills/subagent-driven-development
  shared/skills/shipping-a-slice/       <- skills/finishing-a-development-branch
  shared/skills/requesting-a-review/    <- skills/requesting-code-review
  shared/skills/receiving-a-review/     <- skills/receiving-code-review
  shared/skills/verifying-before-claiming/  <- skills/verification-before-completion
  shared/skills/writing-tests-first/        <- skills/test-driven-development
  shared/skills/debugging-systematically/   <- skills/systematic-debugging

The prompt templates forked from subagent-driven-development are split across
two of those directories: delegating-a-slice carries implementer-prompt.md,
and requesting-a-review carries the two review prompts
(task-reviewer-prompt.md -> reviewer-prompt.md, and re-review-prompt.md).

The verification-before-completion, test-driven-development and
systematic-debugging forks brought their supporting documents along:
writing-tests-first carries writing-good-tests.md, and
debugging-systematically carries root-cause-tracing.md, defense-in-depth.md
and condition-based-waiting.md. Two upstream supporting files were not
ported: find-polluter.sh (build.py does not preserve executable bits, so a
shipped copy would not run) and condition-based-waiting-example.ts (no
precedent in this family for a code-example file, and it was jest-specific).
Their content is folded into the .md files that referenced them instead.

Superpowers' remaining skills (using-git-worktrees and
dispatching-parallel-agents) are not forked here. This plugin is meant to
replace Superpowers rather than run alongside it, so it does not defer to
them by name; until they are forked too, the layers they cover are simply
absent.
